Are you both all right?

00:57:20.840 --> 00:57:21.750
It's that rat.

00:57:21.800 --> 00:57:22.710
It's still alive.

00:57:22.760 --> 00:57:24.230
Dad tried to kill Robbie.

00:57:24.280 --> 00:57:25.590
I told you to sell that rat.

00:57:25.640 --> 00:57:26.190
I hate it.

00:57:26.240 --> 00:57:27.390
It's vermin.

00:57:27.440 --> 00:57:28.430
I don't want to sell it.

00:57:28.480 --> 00:57:31.590
It's a strange smell of burning coming from somewhere.

00:57:31.640 --> 00:57:33.390
Are you cooking one of your casseroles, Nancy?

00:57:33.440 --> 00:57:35.790
No, I'm not.

00:57:35.840 --> 00:57:37.630
Where did the rocket go?

00:57:37.680 --> 00:57:39.510
I didn't see it in the sky.

00:57:39.560 --> 00:57:41.550
I think it was over the fence.

00:57:41.600 --> 00:57:43.870
It's an ex-dars guy.

00:57:43.920 --> 00:57:46.870
No one was hurt.

00:57:46.920 --> 00:57:47.870
Look!

00:57:47.920 --> 00:57:48.870
Oh, no!

00:57:48.920 --> 00:57:50.030
My shed!

00:57:50.080 --> 00:57:51.430
My shed is on fire!

00:57:51.480 --> 00:57:51.950
Help!

00:57:52.000 --> 00:57:53.760
Help, come on, help!

00:57:54.760 --> 00:57:57.350
What a lovely bump I had, Exner.

00:57:57.400 --> 00:57:58.790
That's not a bonfire, Mum.

00:57:58.840 --> 00:58:00.670
It's a real fire.

00:58:00.720 --> 00:58:02.350
Phone the fire brigade, Pete.

00:58:02.400 --> 00:58:03.350
Come on, everyone!

00:58:03.400 --> 00:58:04.190
Get a bucket!

00:58:04.240 --> 00:58:05.150
Come with me!

00:58:05.200 --> 00:58:06.150
OK.

00:58:06.200 --> 00:58:07.150
Where's the phone?

00:58:07.200 --> 00:58:08.150
It's absolutely typical.

00:58:08.200 --> 00:58:09.790
When you want something, you can never find it.

00:58:09.840 --> 00:58:10.790
There it is.

00:58:10.840 --> 00:58:11.790
Behind you, on the bench.

00:58:11.840 --> 00:58:12.790
Ah, yes.

00:58:12.840 --> 00:58:13.790
Who put it there?

00:58:13.840 --> 00:58:14.790
Nine.

00:58:14.840 --> 00:58:15.790
Nine.

00:58:15.840 --> 00:58:16.790
Nine.

00:58:16.840 --> 00:58:17.790
Hello.

00:58:17.840 --> 00:58:19.790
What hung out Chinese?

00:58:19.840 --> 00:58:20.840
Come on again.

00:58:21.200 --> 00:58:22.710
Come on again.

00:58:22.760 --> 00:58:24.390
The Chinese take away again.

00:58:24.440 --> 00:58:25.590
Yes, what a day.

00:58:25.640 --> 00:58:26.590
What a day.

00:58:26.640 --> 00:58:28.990
This is a day to remember, I think.

00:58:29.040 --> 00:58:30.550
Yes, you're right.

00:58:30.600 --> 00:58:33.790
Still, there is one positive result.

00:58:33.840 --> 00:58:34.790
Ha-ha.

00:58:34.840 --> 00:58:36.390
Please tell me what that is.

00:58:36.440 --> 00:58:38.990
I think the days are disaster.

00:58:39.040 --> 00:58:42.550
The lawnmower was in the shed.

00:58:42.600 --> 00:58:47.270
So, of course you were right.

00:58:47.320 --> 00:58:49.990
No more lawnmowering early in the morning.

00:58:50.040 --> 00:58:52.040
Just for a few weeks, anyway.
